            "claim": "Implementing a 20% reservation for in-café orders in 50 pilot Starbucks cafés during weekday peak hours will restrict the number of available mobile order slots, causing some habitual app users and time-pressed commuters to be quoted pickup times later than their personal thresholds. Some will abandon Starbucks for those occasions.",
