                "customer": "Habitual Starbucks app users attempt mobile orders but abandon if quoted slot is >8 minutes late; after two such failures in a week, shift routine to a competitor for the rest of the month. Time-pressed commuters check app and divert if a delay risks lateness. In-store café visitors continue, with increased visit frequency if wait times improve.",
